	"displayName": "Load Project/Library Folder",
	"description": "Import EasyEDA Pro projects (.epro2) and libraries (.elibz2) straight from unzipped folders. The extension walks the folder tree, recognises nested project/library folders, re-packs them in memory and imports them through the official import pipeline - nothing is written to disk, so encrypted/DLP protected clients that block archive import can still load their designs.",
